  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <color=#4f9cfa><size=24>50 LINES</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<color=#4f9cfa><size=24>Bet Per Line: 1</style></color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>WILD</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- Lands on <b>2</b>, <b>3</b>, <b>4</b> and <b>5</b> reels only and\n
      \ substitutes for all symbols except             ,             \n  and             ."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>SCATTER</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- <b>3 Scatter Symbols</b> on reels <b>1</b>, <b>3</b> and <b>5</b>\n
      \ triggers <b><color=#ffd800>Santa's Gift Free Games</color></b>."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>ACTIVE REEL FEATURE</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '- <b>Rapid Win Symbols</b> only on active reels award prizes on them.

      - Increase your denomination and activate more reels to win more of <b>Rapid
      Win Symbols</b>!'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <color=#ffd800>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#ffd800>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3 <color=#ffd800>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>RAPID WIN SYMBOLS</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- Rapid Win Symbol only on active reels award prizes.\n- Rapid Win Symbol
      on an active reel awards one of the followings:\n      1. Coin Prize\n      2.
      One of 5 Santa Collectibles\n      3. Trigger Free Games\n      4. Upgrade of
      Bonus Game Prize\n- Super Rapid Win Symbol on active reel 5 awards one of the
      followings:\n      1. Huge Coin Prize\n      2. 2 random Santa Collectibles\n
      \     3. Trigger Free Games with multiplier X2\n            - Multiplier is
      only applied to the Line Wins and Coin Prize from Rapid Win Symbols\n      4.
      Huge Upgrade of Bonus Game Prize"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>SANTA'S GIFT FREE GAMES</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "- Santa's Gift Free Games can be triggered by 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3,
      and 5\n  or through (Super) Rapid Win Symbol on active reels.\n- In Santa's
      Gift Free Games, Rapid Win Symbol appears in stacks of size 4.\n        -Super
      Rapid Win Symbol on reel 5 can be part of Rapid Win Symbol stacks on reel 5.\n-
      When part of stacks of Rapid Win Symbols lands on a reel, the stack nudges up
      or down\n  to create a full stack on that reel.\n- Any Rapid Win Symbols during
      Santa's Gift Free Games awards prizes on them as in Base Games.\n- Rapid Win
      Symbols on active reels awards one of the followings:\n      1. Coin Prize\n
      \     2. One of 5 Santa Collectibles\n      3. Add additional Free Games\n-
      Super Rapid Win Symbol on active reel 5 awards one of the followings:\n      1.
      Huge Coin Prize\n      2. 2 random Santa Collectibles\n      3. Add additional
      Free Games"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_6
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>PROGRESSION FEATURE</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_6
    value: "- Once player collects all 5 Santa Collectibles, the Bonus Game is triggered.\n-
      The total prize of Bonus Game depends on the player's bet when each Santa Collectible\n
      \ was found.\n- Player can get the same type of Santa Collectibles from Rapid
      or Super Rapid Win Symbols.\n  In this case, the total prize of bonus game will
      be increased."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_7
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>HAPPY EVE BONUS GAME</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_7
    value: "- Player selects one of the 10 items and each item reveals one of the
      following prizes:\n      1. Multiplier: awards the multiplier to the total prize\n
      \     2. Multiplier with Keep Picking: accumulates the multiplier and allows
      one more pick\n      3. Wheel with Keep Picking: awards coin prize from the
      Wheel spin and allows one more pick\n- Player picks until picking an item WITHOUT
      Keep Picking."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>LINES</style></color></size>
